OL,3,GNEWSAOut-of-hours GP move branded
OL,4,A'chaos' by councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor says he has been left
OL,7,Fconfused by the "chaos" caused by an
OL,8,Fout-of-hours GP service moving from a
OL,9,FKent hospital.
OL,11,FKent and Medway Integrated Care Board
OL,12,F(ICB) moved Medway On Call Care
OL,13,F(MedOCC) out of Medway Maritime
OL,14,FHospital on 28 September.
OL,16,FCouncillor Dan McDonald told a Medway
OL,17,FCouncil Health and Social Care
OL,18,Fcommittee that the authority had only
OL,19,Fbeen notified of the move three days
OL,20,Fprior, according to the Local Democracy
OL,21,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
