OL,3,GNEWSAOut-of-hours GP move branded
OL,4,A'chaos' by councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames MacDonald, deputy chief medical
OL,7,Fofficer for the ICB, said the move was
OL,8,Fintended to be temporary, and the
OL,9,Flong-term plan was to split the
OL,10,Fout-of-hours service into two.
